Copied from ../KallRecon without modifications (lib/, deps.mk, LICENSE).

Local change: lib/core.c resolves kallsyms_lookup_name through a disabled
(never armed) kprobe before any table scan, and kallsyms_name_to_addr()
uses it directly when found. Samsung Exynos EL2 forbids reads of some
kernel image pages; the forward scan from sprint_symbol hit one and the
stage-2 fault reset the device (S5E9945, 6.1.162-android14-11).
kallrecon_ready() replaces the klnum_val check in callers.
